////Complete Real-Time Request Flow////

kubectl apply deployment.yaml
            ↓
API Server receives request
            ↓
etcd stores desired state
            ↓
Scheduler selects node
            ↓
Controller ensures pod creation
            ↓
Kubelet starts container
            ↓
Application becomes accessible

Real-Time DevOps Usage

Task	                    Component Used
Deploy application	      kubectl
Cluster management	      API Server
Pod scheduling	          Scheduler
Auto healing	            Controller
Node communication	       Kubelet
Data storage	              etcd
